    "body": "fix on issue/1997-envelope-camera-target · PR #2000 · pinned by frame_target_is_the_same_with_the_envelope_on_and_off, open_frames_the_part_with_the_envelope_on_and_off · merges when reviewed\n\nFinding: no commit put the work envelope into the camera target. The envelope (#1567, `c0b4dfc85`) is overlay lines only, and `State::frame_all` reads only facets and WCS origins. The pivot is the target that a document open left in place: `State::reset_for_open` did not touch the camera (the same in v0.20.0). The fix frames the camera at each open. The pointer pivot is filed as #1998.",
